          "SourceString": "12人炸弹派对\n\n1.开局会随机指定几名玩家为炸弹携带者。  \n2.炸弹在一段时间后或回合结束时会发生爆炸。\n3.炸弹携带者可近战传出炸弹。\n4.该模式血量无限，受击后会被大幅度减速。\n5.每回合的幸存者可以获得积分，累计积分排名高的玩家获胜。",
          "LocalizedString": "12-Player Boom Fest\n\n1. At the start of each round, a few players are randomly chosen as Carriers.\n2. The Bomb explodes after a set time or when the round ends.\n3. Carriers can pass the Bomb using melee attacks.\n4. HP mechanic removed; getting hit significantly slows you down.\n5. Survive each round to earn points; the highest score wins."
        },
