          "SourceString": "5V5攻守对抗\n\n获胜条件：\n1.进攻方：在规定时间内，护送运载目标抵达终点\n2.防守方：在规定时间内，阻止运载目标抵达终点\n\n特殊机制：\n1.靠近或贴上运载目标即可控制它的行进\n2.待在安全区或等待重生时可调试弦能增幅网络\n3.遵循周期性规律进行集体重生",
          "LocalizedString": "5v5 Escort Battle\n\nVictory Conditions:\n1. Attackers: Escort the payload to the destination within the specified time.\n2. Defenders: Prevent the payload from reaching the destination within the specified time.\nSpecial Mechanics:\n1. Approach or stick on the payload to advance it forward.\n2. Adjust the String Energy Network while in the Safe Zone or waiting to respawn.\n3. Team members will respawn together periodically."
